{"id":"vod_sn_37298","vodId":"37298","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"失忆煽动WIXOSS","name_cn":"失忆煽动WIXOSS","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/22ebac57992860319cc15b91447e630c.jpg"},"summary":"穗村玲子（桥本千波 配音）是一名个性稍微有些内向的女高中生，在转学去了新的学校之后，玲子发现自己的性格导致自己久久无法融入班级圈子里，感到稍稍有些孤独。最近班上流行着名为“WIXOSS”的卡牌游戏，玲子希望以此为契机能够拉近自己和同学们之间的距离，于是走进商店买了一组卡牌。　　让玲子没有想到的是，在打开卡牌的一瞬间，牌面上的立绘少女莉露（伊藤静 配音）动了起来，原来，玲子被卷入了一个以记忆为赌注的游戏之中。她的全部记忆被浓缩封印到了五枚硬币之中，这就是她手上的全部筹码，玲子要利用这五枚硬币和其他的参与者进行对决，如果失败了，她将会失去所有的记忆。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b5AXxXzMLx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EXNny0QKyQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B1AueybY5D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3VqY5EEGVt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sFkc4J7hDi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DW2qdJk8Jm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mNi6y3aH2k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LNG9bBD7gm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AnEwBkEPHZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hEvjkvyVRv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m2FsrppUuT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t9dhnZAhzL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dkELAGpkJ51/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:12.618Z"}